Project: {{config.metadata.name}} ({{stack}} / {{architecture}})
Doc language: {{language}}

Help register an object storage integration (S3, MinIO, GCS, Azure Blob).
Return ONLY a JSON object — no Markdown fences, no prose.

User input:
"""
{{extra.userDescription}}
"""

Schema:
{
  "name": string,
  "vendor": string,
  "purpose": string,
  "endpoints": [{ "name": string, "protocol": string, "url": string }],
  "slaTargets": { "availability": string, "latencyP95Ms": number },
  "auth": { "mode": string, "secretsRef": string },
  "errorHandling": string,
  "rateLimits": string,
  "observability": string,
  "versioning": string,
  "extra": {
    "vendor": string,
    "buckets": string[],
    "encryption": string,
    "lifecyclePolicy": string
  }
}

Constraints:
- Do NOT include "id".
- Specify encryption (SSE-KMS / customer-managed keys), lifecycle, retention.

Return JSON only.
